<title>SWEDEN: SOCCER-HELSINGBORG AND ANDERLECHT DRAW 0-0 IN UEFA CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HELSINGBORG AND ANDERLECHT DRAW 0-0 IN UEFA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINGBORG, Sweden 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helsingborg of Sweden and Anderlecht of Belgium drew their UEFA Cup third round first leg match 0-0 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,304.</p>
</text>
